# Super Fitness architecture

Vite + React + TypeScript. Not Next.js.

## Feature-based

Group by feature, not by type (`pages/`, `layouts/`, `components/` as global buckets).

```
src/features/auth/
  components/     # AuthLayout, form pieces used only by auth
  pages/          # LoginPage, RegisterPage, ...
  api/            # axios calls for this feature
  hooks/
  types/
```

Shared UI stays in `src/components/ui` (shadcn). Shared tokens in `src/lib`.
A route file may compose features; it must not own feature UI.

## Auth is custom

Do not use NextAuth, Auth.js, Clerk, or an `AuthProvider` / session provider.

- Login / register / OTP talk to the API with axios
- Session is a token you store and attach to requests (interceptor), not React context wrapping the tree
- `AuthLayout` is a visual shell (background + brand column + `Outlet`), not an auth state provider
